id: warding-weapon
name: Warding Weapon
kind: crafting
slots: 1
special: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Special. Wielded: Damage Reduction 2(bT) higher, and 1(T) on your Dice Score in any Clash an
  Opponent opens.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: While wielding this Weapon, increase your Damage Reduction by 2(bT) and increase
  your Dice Score in any Clash initiated by an Opponent by 1(T).
text: >
  Warding Weapon: This Weapon protects you from harm.
  –Weapon Type: All
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: While wielding this Weapon, increase your Damage Reduction by 2(bT) and increase
  your Dice Score in any Clash initiated by an Opponent by 1(T).

---

# "Any Clash initiated by an Opponent", by the table's ruling: every roll set against one they
# opened - their attack's Strike against your Dodge or Parry, a Might Clash, a Saving Throw, a
# Skill Clash. Never one you opened. Once, however many of these are in hand.
[passive]
damageReduction += 2(bT);
clash.defending += 1(T);
